2	//  Your iteration harness for `./gemm -c`: verifies correctness against a CPU
3	//  reference over a fixed size sweep, then prints a self-measured throughput
4	//  line so you can see progress while you optimize.
5	//
6	//  NOTE: this printed number is for YOUR convenience only — it is NOT how you
